 <section class="faq-section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
 <div class="container">
 <div class="faq-header reveal">
 <span class="section-label">Common Questions</span>
 <h2 id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
 <p>Everything you need to know about our nano-hemp products, from the science behind them to shipping and returns.</p>
 </div>

 <!-- Category: About Nano-Hemp -->
 <div class="faq-category reveal">
 <h3 class="faq-category-title">About Nano-Hemp</h3>
 <div class="accordion" role="region" aria-label="About Nano-Hemp frequently asked questions">

 <!-- FAQ 1 -->
 <div class="accordion-item">
 <button
 class="accordion-trigger"
 aria-expanded="false"
 aria-controls="faq-panel-1"
 onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"
 >
 <span class="accordion-question">What is nano-hemp and how is it different from regular hemp?</span>
 <span class="accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true">
 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
 </span>
 </button>
 <div class="accordion-panel" id="faq-panel-1">
 <div class="accordion-answer">
 <p>Nano-hemp is hemp that has been processed using our proprietary nano fragmentation technology to create particles smaller than 100 nanometers. To put that in perspective, traditional hemp particles range from 5,000 to 10,000 nanometers in size.</p>
 <p>Because nano-hemp particles are so much smaller, your body can absorb them <strong>3-8 times more efficiently</strong> than regular hemp. That means:</p>
 <ul>
 <li><strong>Faster onset</strong>, you may notice effects within 15-30 minutes instead of 45-90 minutes</li>
 <li><strong>Better bioavailability</strong>, more of the active compounds reach your system</li>
 <li><strong>Longer duration</strong>, effects tend to last longer due to efficient cellular uptake</li>
 <li><strong>Smaller serving sizes</strong>, you need less product to achieve the desired result</li>
 </ul>
 <p>Think of it like this: traditional hemp particles are like trying to push a beach ball through a keyhole, while nano-hemp particles are like pouring sand through it. Our technology breaks those beach balls into grains of sand.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- FAQ 2 -->
 <div class="accordion-item">
 <button
 class="accordion-trigger"
 aria-expanded="false"
 aria-controls="faq-panel-2"
 onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"
 >
 <span class="accordion-question">How does proprietary nano fragmentation technology work?</span>
 <span class="accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true">
 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
 </span>
 </button>
 <div class="accordion-panel" id="faq-panel-2">
 <div class="accordion-answer">
 <p>Our proprietary nano fragmentation and encapsulation technology was developed by PhD scientists at a <strong>powerful West Coast biotech company</strong>. While the exact process is protected intellectual property, we can share the science at a high level:</p>
 <ul>
 <li>The process begins with premium, lab-tested hemp extract sourced from quality-grown hemp plants</li>
 <li>Through advanced engineering, the hemp particles are broken down to nano-size, less than 100 nanometers in diameter, this is the fragmentation step</li>
 <li>Each nano-particle is then individually encapsulated with a protective coating using our clean carrier ingredients</li>
 <li>This encapsulation step is critical: without it, the tiny nano-particles would naturally reassemble into large clusters, undoing the fragmentation</li>
 <li>The coating locks each particle at nano-size, preventing reassembly and maintaining maximum bioavailability</li>
 <li>The result is a stable, water-compatible formula that your body can absorb 3-8x more efficiently</li>
 </ul>
 <p>What makes our technology different is the two-step approach: fragmentation creates the small particles, and encapsulation keeps them small. Both steps are essential, and both are validated through third-party laboratory testing on every batch we produce.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- FAQ 3 -->
 <div class="accordion-item">
 <button
 class="accordion-trigger"
 aria-expanded="false"
 aria-controls="faq-panel-3"
 onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"
 >
 <span class="accordion-question">How long does it take to feel the effects?</span>
 <span class="accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true">
 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
 </span>
 </button>
 <div class="accordion-panel" id="faq-panel-3">
 <div class="accordion-answer">
 <p>Most people begin to feel the effects of our nano-hemp products within <strong>15-30 minutes</strong>. This is significantly faster than traditional hemp products, which typically take 45-90 minutes to take effect.</p>
 <p>Several factors can influence how quickly you feel the effects:</p>
 <ul>
 <li><strong>Your metabolism</strong>, faster metabolisms may notice effects sooner</li>
 <li><strong>Body weight</strong>, serving size can be adjusted based on individual needs</li>
 <li><strong>Empty vs. full stomach</strong>, taking nano-hemp on an empty stomach may lead to faster absorption</li>
 <li><strong>Consistency of use</strong>, many people report that effects build and improve with regular daily use over 1-2 weeks</li>
 </ul>
 <p>We always recommend being consistent with your routine for at least two weeks to give your body time to fully respond. Individual results vary, and finding your ideal serving size may take a little experimentation.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- FAQ 4 -->
 <div class="accordion-item">
 <button
 class="accordion-trigger"
 aria-expanded="false"
 aria-controls="faq-panel-4"
 onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"
 >
 <span class="accordion-question">Will nano-hemp show up on a drug test?</span>
 <span class="accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true">
 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
 </span>
 </button>
 <div class="accordion-panel" id="faq-panel-4">
 <div class="accordion-answer">
 <p>Our products contain <strong>No THC</strong>. They are made with pure hemp extract that has been refined to remove all detectable levels of THC.</p>
 <p>Every batch is <strong>third-party lab tested</strong> to verify THC content and ensure purity. These lab reports are available upon request.</p>
 <p>However, we always recommend that if you are subject to drug testing for work or other reasons, you should inform your employer or testing administrator that you use hemp-based wellness products. While our products contain no THC, some highly sensitive tests may detect other hemp compounds. We want you to feel confident and informed in your choices.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>

